2026-10-14T07:11:46.0463397Z             "body": "Post-start preservation probe correction, exact current head `5e0b32830f961b3236c7cf8f74cf8f676e98fbaa`, tree `f2152e240b355cd141612b783c6ccf04f5c8383a`, base `6d750914d8565acdd496767a7dd935811b5a89b2`;59 application paths, no WP/audit attribute changes. Only2 paths differ from previous8d564c24: real readiness rehearsal and one appended policy-schema regression. All runtime owner/schema/scientific/prebinding/history/policy/scanner source remains byte-identical.\n\nOriginal new CI38515104824 attempt1 remains **FAILED** and was never retried: actual closed server366/5565, client, both real Docker builds and boundary passed. PRE_199 shipped entrypoint reachedhealth and policy-before-chart checks; the following new post-start proof failed its composite preservation assertion. [Original ZIP/API/every archive-entry hash and exact step logs](https://github.com/yigini/soilfer-lims/tree/b2558c6ebab17d0453373fb057d6640ae0418f7a/WP/backlog-resume-20261013/issue214-policy-ci38515104824-closed-step-analysis). A retained new owned reproduction proves secondary original-file readonly chart/count inspections create WAL/SHM while all P/NO_OP0/COMPLETE_214/empty-row assertions pass. This is an owned reproduction, not independent inspection of the discarded CI volume.\n\nThe corrected probe runs secondary chart/count inspections on the exact retained snapshot already returned by the policy owner. It keeps EVERY existing classification, zero-change, empty-row and original DB/WAL/SHM equality predicate, and additionally binds the snapshot's original triple hashes to the initial observation. The actual shipped entrypoint still runs on the genuine PRE_199 volume and must reach health/guard order; no preprocessing or weakened gate. The appended regression extracts and runs the ACTUAL embedded rehearsal programme against a new owned WAL-mode database without sidecars, verifying the complete original triple stays unchanged. Existing18 policy-schema cases and all stock assertions remain unchanged.\n\nClosed focused **8/8 suites219/219 tests PASS**, both scanners and stock bootstrap, exact8path inventory/full366discovery, all421 frozen inputs unchanged; all other419 inputs identical to previous full stock CI. Prior full local366/5565 and actual stockCI366/5565 remain historical evidence for their exact8d source; no fresh local full5566 claim. New automatic real CI must independently pass **366/5566** plus client/bothDockerbuilds/boundary/readiness and fresh exact-head Claudio audit before merge. [Closed owned diagnostic and regression originals/hashes](https://github.com/yigini/soilfer-lims/tree/b2558c6ebab17d0453373fb057d6640ae0418f7a/WP/backlog-resume-20261013/issue214-policy-ci38515104824-closed-step-analysis/closed-index.json).\n\nAccepted6160619940 scope is unchanged: canonical policy DDL only, no normalization/data rows/backfill/catch/guard weakening; production kit readonly must PRESENT/NO_OP0 with retainedsnapshotdiskaccounting, otherwiseSTOP/noapply. No production collection or operation. Both failed runs38467368095/e47b and38515104824/8d remain immutable. Final source audit request follows actual newgreenCI, then #209.\n\nCurrent probe and added regression diff:\n```diff\ndiff --git a/server/scripts/rehearsal_deployment_readiness.cjs b/server/scripts/rehearsal_deployment_readiness.cjs\nindex 51396679..b0cbd916 100644\n--- a/server/scripts/rehearsal_deployment_readiness.cjs\n+++ b/server/scripts/rehearsal_deployment_readiness.cjs\n@@ -1372,12 +1372,14 @@ async function runSuite() {\n            fs.existsSync(dbPath+suffix)?crypto.createHash('sha256').update(fs.readFileSync(dbPath+suffix)).digest('hex'):null]));\n          const before=hash(),installer=require('./scripts/install_lab_policy_schema');\n          const ready=installer.assertLabPolicyStartupReady(dbPath),again=installer.installLabPolicySchema({dbPath,apply:true});\n-         const charts=require('./scripts/install_control_charts').assertControlChartStartupReady(dbPath);\n-         const db=new Database(dbPath,{readonly:true,fileMustExist:true});\n+         const inspected=ready.readonlySnapshot.path;\n+         const charts=require('./scripts/install_control_charts').assertControlChartStartupReady(inspected);\n+         const db=new Database(inspected,{readonly:true,fileMustExist:true});\n          const counts=Object.fromEntries(['LabPolicy','LabPolicyOverride'].map(name=>[name,db.prepare('SELECT count(*) n FROM \"'+name+'\"').get().n]));db.close();\n          if(ready.classification!=='PRESENT'||again.mode!=='NO_OP'||again.totalChanges!==0||charts.classification!=='COMPLETE_214'||charts.totalChanges!==0||\n-           Object.values(counts).some(Boolean)||JSON.stringify(hash())!==JSON.stringify(before))throw Error('Policy/214 startup or repeat preservation differs');\n-         console.log(JSON.stringify({ready,again,charts,counts,dbWalShmPreserved:true}));`\n+           Object.values(counts).some(Boolean)||JSON.stringify(ready.readonlySnapshot.originalDbWalShmSha256)!==JSON.stringify(before)||\n+           JSON.stringify(hash())!==JSON.stringify(before))throw Error('Policy/214 startup or repeat preservation differs');\n+         console.log(JSON.stringify({ready,again,charts,counts,dbWalShmPreserved:true,secondaryInspectionsOnRetainedSnapshot:true}));`\n     ],{encoding:'utf8'}).trim();\n     const policyAfter=JSON.parse(policyAfterOutput);\n     console.log(JSON.stringify({policyChartEntrypointProof:{scenario:'PRE_199-default-entrypoint-COMPLETE_214',before:policyBefore,after:policyAfter}}));\ndiff --git a/server/tests/contracts/issue_214_lab_policy_schema.test.js b/server/tests/contracts/issue_214_lab_policy_schema.test.js\nindex 75ccd825..a2940703 100644\n--- a/server/tests/contracts/issue_214_lab_policy_schema.test.js\n+++ b/server/tests/contracts/issue_214_lab_policy_schema.test.js\n@@ -125,3 +125,27 @@ test('policy installation and read-only readiness precede214; Docker packages th\n    